flowchart Refund Decision
// stress: long-labels — node text of a full sentence, and a title on a narrow chart
(Customer asks for a refund through the support portal) -> <Was the purchase made within the last thirty days?>
<Was the purchase made within the last thirty days?> -yes-> [Issue a full refund to the original payment method automatically]
<Was the purchase made within the last thirty days?> -no-> [Escalate to a support lead who reviews the account history]
